# Statement 2 — Final Data Cleaning Documentation

## Objective
Prepare a clean, validated ministry-level government budget dataset without modifying the original raw or standardized files.

## Input
`data/transformed/statement_2_standardized.csv`

## Output
`data/cleaned/statement_2_final_cleaned.csv`

## Cleaning Activities
1. Identified and removed three repeated header rows.
2. Standardized ministry code and ministry name text.
3. Converted financial columns to numeric data types.
4. Preserved the PDF-verified negative Operating Expenditure of Power Division.
5. Recalculated expenditure reconciliation.
6. Generated missing-value and final cleaning reports.
7. Preserved the original and standardized input files.

